{"id":"wb-4-181","name":"雷祖祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"雷祖祠","text":"雷祖祠位于中国广东省雷州市西郊英榜山，为祀奉唐代首任雷州刺史陈文玉的祠堂，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。\n雷祖祠始建于唐贞观十六年（642年），现存建筑基本为明清所建。建筑群坐西北朝东南，占地一万余平方米，共分三进，依次为山门、拜亭及大殿、太祖阁，均为硬山顶建筑。祠内还保存有五代时期石人四尊及宋至清碑刻四十余块。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9B%B7%E7%A5%96%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":89509111,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89509111","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/55faa08cd3ac163f5bd8de67.jpg","title":"Leizhou_Leizu_Ci_2014.02.27_15-34-17.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Leizhou_Leizu_Ci_2014.02.27_15-34-17.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/Leizhou_Leizu_Ci_2014.02.27_15-34-17.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"雷州雷祖祠","width":320,"height":213}}